<title>ITALY: RUGBY UNION-AUSTRALIA BEAT ITALY A 55-19.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-AUSTRALIA BEAT ITALY A 55-19.</headline>
<dateline>CATANIA, Sicily 1996-10-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia beat Italy A 55-19 (halftime 31-9) in the first match of their European rugby union tour in Sicily on Saturday night.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Australia - Tries: Tune, Little, Tombs, Roff, Payne, Connors, Robinson, Kefu. Conversions: Wallace 6, Penalty: Wallace.</p>
<p>Italy - Try: Rosselli. Conversion: Mazzariol. Penalties: Mazzariol 3, drop goal: Mazzariol</p>
<p>Attendance: 3,000</p>
</text>
